<title>GERMANY: German IWKA gets okay for Ex-Cell-O buy.</title>
<headline>German IWKA gets okay for Ex-Cell-O buy.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German machinery-maker Industrie-Werke Karlsruhe-Augsburg AG (IWKA) said on Tuesday the German cartel office had raised no objections to its offer for machine tool-maker Ex-Cell-O Holding.</p>
<p>IWKA in November offered 170 marks ($107) per share in the company in a friendly takeover move.</p>
<p>Ex-Cell-O closed bourse trade on Tuesday at 168.80 marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.588 German Marks)</p>
</text>
